---
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';
// Captured from a real `gg autopilot --acp` session driven over the protocol (no API key set), abridged.
---
<div class="acp">
  <Terminal title="gg autopilot --acp (no API key)" label="A real ACP session: the client sends the find-ceiling slash command and receives a plan, tool calls and a result">
<pre class="wire"><span class="dim">← </span><b>available_commands_update</b>
<span class="dim">     </span>/dry-run  /find-ceiling  /slo-guard
<span class="dim">→ </span><b>session/prompt</b>
<span class="dim">     </span><span class="acc">/find-ceiling api.http max_p99=200 start_rps=30</span>
<span class="dim">     </span><span class="acc">max_rps=300</span>
<span class="dim">← </span><b>plan</b>       start · watch · report
<span class="dim">← </span><b>tool_call</b>  start_simulation <span class="dim">mode=find-ceiling</span>
<span class="dim">← </span><b>tool_call</b>  get_live_telemetry <span class="dim">wait_s=5</span>
<span class="dim">     × 12, the last one reports</span> <span class="ok">ceiling_found, 118 RPS</span>
<span class="dim">← </span><b>tool_call</b>  stop_simulation <span class="dim">report=md</span>
<span class="dim">← </span><b>agent_message_chunk</b>
<span class="dim">     </span>/find-ceiling on api.http: run finished
<span class="dim">     </span>- ceiling: <b>118 RPS</b> (ceiling_found)
<span class="dim">     </span>- reason: ceiling confirmed at 118 RPS
<span class="dim">     </span>- 4847 requests, error rate 0.02%,
<span class="dim">       </span>p50 9 ms, p95 401 ms, p99 401 ms
<span class="dim">     </span>- snapshot: …/run-20261117-014920.snap
<span class="dim">     </span>- report: …/run-20261117-014920.report.md
<span class="dim">← </span><b>stopReason</b>  end_turn</pre>
  </Terminal>
  <p class="caption">A real session, abridged. Any ACP client renders these updates as a plan, tool cards and a message.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .acp { width: 100%; }
  .wire { margin: 0; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; font: inherit; line-height: 1.65; background: none; padding: 0; }
  .acp :global(.term-body) { font-size: 0.74rem; }
  .caption {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
